se,"text":"She is currently having an affair with a man who has a wife and child."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c68796"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「生徒とこんなことになるなんて、教師失格よね。」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒から「鋼鉄の処女」と呼ばれる学年副主任。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールで理知的な性格で、教師としての仕事もビジネスとして割り切っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳しく息の詰まるような授業は生徒達に不評ではあるが、脱落者を出さない指導方法は定評がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、妻子ある男性と不倫の関係にあるようだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17267","sourceWorkId":"3701","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とつばめが通っている槁ヶ丘学園の教師。担当は英語。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「鋼鉄の処女」の異名を持つ彼女の授業は非常に厳しく、息が詰まるほどの緊張感が漂う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしその指導方法は的確でわかりやすく、脱落する学生は少ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お堅い印象を与えるが、見た目よりは柔らかい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"※『僕と4人の女教師』『てすた～Teach＆Study～』に登場。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17267","sourceWorkId":"11250","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｂ：85cm　Ｗ：59cm　Ｈ：87cm"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒から『鋼鉄の処女』と呼ばれる、女教師。学年副主任。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒達に接する態度や授業を「仕事」としているクールな面を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"授業は厳しく息の詰まるような授業を行うが、一人花壇に水をやるような意外な一面も持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、妻子ある男性と不倫関係にある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「先生だってね・・・ただの女なのよ・・・」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59081"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/5284163a9b4af862173142925cfe780118a07b81bb6e985b427d9df8ef431e2a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7bf6ea613c031622f41122e4b62c5c9a2ec51e7efe14cfddaa305828fc6e8a52.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石松千恵美","creatorId":"vndb:s1164","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1164","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1164","name":"石松 千恵美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:229770:59081:4273:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c68798","characterName":"フェリア・神田＝モンデリヒト","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59082","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"217714"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23184"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68798"},"originalCharacterName":"フェリア・神田＝モンデリヒト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"138"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a genius girl who went to a university in Germany."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is also quite famous worldwide as a researcher, and is the only teacher at the school to have completed a doctoral course. She is currently submitting her dissertation to an academic conference, and while waiting for the results, she is teaching on the side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a teacher, but she is younger than her students. She is selfish, egoistic, arrogant, and super-cheeky. Basically, she thinks students are low-brained idiots who are no better than livestock."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of her genius, the test questions she makes are extremely difficult, and it is extremely difficult to get more than 10 points (of course, the perfect score is 100 points)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She thinks that the main character is no better than a monkey."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c68798"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の非常勤講師で化学担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飛び級により海外の有名学院で最年少の博士号を取得した天才。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はどこかの研究室にいるらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"科学部の顧問を引き受けており、自分の待機室である化学準備室を科学部室として提供している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23184","sourceWorkId":"8743","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｂ：58cm　Ｗ：45cm　Ｈ：62cm"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドイツの大学を飛び級で卒業した天才少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界的に研究者としてもかなり有名で、学園の教師では唯一博士課程を修了している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、学会に論文を提出中で、その結果待ちの片手間で教師をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"経歴は誰にも負けない立派なものだが・・・でも、基本的に子供。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"立場は教師だが、学生よりも年下の先生。強気で我侭で傲慢、さらに超生意気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に学生を家畜以下の低脳馬鹿と思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天才ゆえに彼女の作るテスト問題は超難問で、１０点以上取るのが至難の業である（当然１００点満点）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことはサル以下と思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「１２cmか・・・平均より小さいよね？これ・・・」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59082"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36bdee116e12c7ad1112460a0e34043bd114011a38d1373ac162d080cc22a9fa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/171320b5d534e69a8f2f81ab993d18e68d55e94b6201d219f775709fa61bde97.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"いのくちゆか","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:229770:59082:4490:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c68794","characterName":"渡辺 瞬","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c68794"},"originalCharacterName":"渡辺 瞬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"40"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this story."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a feminine appearance, but he is also feminine inside. He is a shy and timid boy who is not physically strong, and his grades are not so good. He was bullied as a child."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is interested in women to a certain extent, but has never had any experience with a woman because he lacks courage. Perhaps because of his bullying nature, his teacher, Tsuzumi, has taken an interest in him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c68794"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/807d5c28a94a423edeacd0a863c07a47414dce84518ef15ead32e0e027bcca02.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/2136f4d527f89f3b9d2e7829cdb85c0cecaca4897f189032dda7c0889ad7972f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"羽守 直","creatorId":"vndb:s25439","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25439","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25439","name":"羽守 直","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:16268","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c68795","characterName":"園川 香澄","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c68795"},"originalCharacterName":"園川 香澄","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Assistant homeroom teacher in the main character's class. She is a new female teacher who has just g